---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the channel.
---@field partnerId? string The ID of the partner that owns the channel.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the channel. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum length of 240 bytes.
---@field channelId? string Output only. The unique ID of the channel. Assigned by the system.
---@field negativelyTargetedLineItemCount? string Output only. Number of line items that are directly targeting this channel negatively.
---@field positivelyTargetedLineItemCount? string Output only. Number of line items that are directly targeting this channel positively.
---@field advertiserId? string The ID of the advertiser that owns the channel.

---Details for assigned channel targeting option. This will be populated in the details field of an AssignedTargetingOption when targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CHANNEL`.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ChannelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails
---@field channelId? string Required. ID of the channel. Should refer to the channel ID field on a [Partner-owned channel](partners.channels#Channel.FIELDS.channel_id) or [advertiser-owned channel](advertisers.channels#Channel.FIELDS.channel_id) resource.
---@field negative? boolean Indicates if this option is being negatively targeted. For advertiser level assigned targeting option, this field must be true.

---@alias gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ChannelList gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.Channel[]

---Settings for advertisers that use both Campaign Manager 360 (CM360) and third-party ad servers.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CmHybridConfig
---@field cmFloodlightConfigId? string Required. Immutable. ID of the CM360 Floodlight configuration linked with the DV360 advertiser.
---@field dv360ToCmDataSharingEnabled? boolean Whether or not to include DV360 data in CM360 data transfer reports.
---@field cmSyncableSiteIds? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.StringList A list of CM360 sites whose placements will be synced to DV360 as creatives. If absent or empty in CreateAdvertiser method, the system will automatically create a CM360 site. Removing sites from this list may cause DV360 creatives synced from CM360 to be deleted. At least one site must be specified.
---@field cmFloodlightLinkingAuthorized? boolean Required. Immutable. By setting this field to `true`, you, on behalf of your company, authorize the sharing of information from the given Floodlight configuration to this Display & Video 360 advertiser.
---@field cmAccountId? string Required. Immutable. Account ID of the CM360 Floodlight configuration linked with the DV360 advertiser.
---@field cmAdvertiserIds? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.StringList Output only. The set of CM360 Advertiser IDs sharing the CM360 Floodlight configuration.
---@field dv360ToCmCostReportingEnabled? boolean Whether or not to report DV360 cost to CM360.

---A Campaign Manager 360 tracking ad.
