---@field cmPlacementId? string Optional. The placement ID of the campaign manager 360 tracking Ad.
---@field cmCreativeId? string Optional. The creative ID of the campaign manager 360 tracking Ad.
---@field cmAdId? string Optional. The ad ID of the campaign manager 360 tracking Ad.

