---@alias gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CombinedAudienceList gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CombinedAudience[]

---Details of combined audience targeting setting.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CombinedAudienceTargetingSetting
---@field combinedAudienceId? string Required. Combined audience id of combined audience targeting setting. This id is combined_audience_id.

---@alias gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CombinedAudienceTargetingSettingList gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CombinedAudienceTargetingSetting[]

---Common attributes for in-stream, non-skippable and bumper ads.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CommonInStreamAttribute
---@field actionHeadline? string Optional. The headline of the call-to-action banner.
---@field companionBanner? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ImageAsset Optional. The image which shows next to the video ad.
---@field finalUrl? string Required. The URL address of the webpage that people reach after they click the ad.
---@field trackingUrl? string Output only. The URL address loaded in the background for tracking purposes. In v4 and earlier, this field represents the tracking URL specified by the user manually. This can be found at userSpecifiedTrackingUrl in v5.
---@field video? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.YoutubeVideoDetails Required. Immutable. The YouTube video of the ad.
---@field actionButtonLabel? string Optional. The text on the call-to-action button. Must be set if actionHeadline is set.
---@field displayUrl? string Required. The webpage address that appears with the ad.

