---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentStreamTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails
---@field contentStreamType? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentStreamTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetailsContentStreamTypeEnum|string Output only. The content stream type.
