---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CreatePartnersTargetingTypesAssignedTargetingOptionsRequest
---@field audioContentTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AudioContentTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audio content type details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIO_CONTENT_TYPE`.
---@field digitalContentLabelExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DigitalContentLabelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Digital content label details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DIGITAL_CONTENT_LABEL_EXCLUSION`. Digital content labels are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level digital content label exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude content labels in addition to advertiser exclusions, but can't override them. A line item won't serve if all the digital content labels are excluded.
---@field ageRangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AgeRangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Age range details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AGE_RANGE`.
---@field youtubeVideoDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.YoutubeVideoAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube video details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_VIDEO`.
---@field inventorySourceDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.InventorySourceAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Inventory source details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_INVENTORY_SOURCE_DEAL`.
---@field environmentDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.EnvironmentAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Environment details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_ENVIRONMENT`.
---@field householdIncomeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.HouseholdIncomeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Household income details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_HOUSEHOLD_INCOME`.
---@field contentGenreDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentGenreAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content genre details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_GENRE`.
---@field carrierAndIspDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CarrierAndIspAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Carrier and ISP details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CARRIER_AND_ISP`.
---@field contentInstreamPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentInstreamPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content instream position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_INSTREAM_POSITION`.
---@field geoRegionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.GeoRegionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Geographic region details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_GEO_REGION`.
---@field youtubeChannelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.YoutubeChannelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube channel details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL`.
---@field appDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AppAssignedTargetingOptionDetails App details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_APP`.
---@field inventorySourceGroupDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.InventorySourceGroupAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Inventory source group details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_INVENTORY_SOURCE_GROUP`.
---@field genderDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.GenderAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Gender details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_GENDER`.
---@field sensitiveCategoryExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.SensitiveCategoryAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Sensitive category details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_SENSITIVE_CATEGORY_EXCLUSION`. Sensitive categories are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level sensitive category exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude sensitive categories in addition to advertiser exclusions, but can't override them.
---@field urlDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.UrlAssignedTargetingOptionDetails URL details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_URL`.
---@field deviceTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DeviceTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Device Type details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DEVICE_TYPE`.
---@field dayAndTimeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DayAndTimeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Day and time details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DAY_AND_TIME`.
---@field omidDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.OmidAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Open Measurement enabled inventory details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_OMID`.
---@field subExchangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.SubExchangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Sub-exchange details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_SUB_EXCHANGE`.
---@field negativeKeywordListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.NegativeKeywordListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Keyword details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_NEGATIVE_KEYWORD_LIST`. A maximum of 4 negative keyword lists can be assigned to a resource.
---@field contentOutstreamPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentOutstreamPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content outstream position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_OUTSTREAM_POSITION`.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name for this assigned targeting option.
---@field proximityLocationListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ProximityLocationListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Proximity location list details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_PROXIMITY_LOCATION_LIST`.
---@field assignedTargetingOptionIdAlias? string Output only. An alias for the assigned_targeting_option_id. This value can be used in place of `assignedTargetingOptionId` when retrieving or deleting existing targeting. This field will only be supported for all assigned targeting options of the following targeting types: * `TARGETING_TYPE_AGE_RANGE` * `TARGETING_TYPE_DEVICE_TYPE` * `TARGETING_TYPE_DIGITAL_CONTENT_LABEL_EXCLUSION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_ENVIRONMENT` * `TARGETING_TYPE_EXCHANGE` * `TARGETING_TYPE_GENDER` * `TARGETING_TYPE_HOUSEHOLD_INCOME` * `TARGETING_TYPE_NATIVE_CONTENT_POSITION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_OMID` * `TARGETING_TYPE_PARENTAL_STATUS` * `TARGETING_TYPE_SENSITIVE_CATEGORY_EXCLUSION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_VIDEO_PLAYER_SIZE` * `TARGETING_TYPE_VIEWABILITY` This field is also supported for line item assigned targeting options of the following targeting types: * `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_INSTREAM_POSITION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_OUTSTREAM_POSITION`
---@field sessionPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.SessionPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Session position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_SESSION_POSITION`.
---@field onScreenPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.OnScreenPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails On screen position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_ON_SCREEN_POSITION`.
---@field keywordDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.KeywordAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Keyword details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_KEYWORD`. A maximum of 5000 direct negative keywords can be assigned to a resource. No limit on number of positive keywords that can be assigned.
---@field assignedTargetingOptionId? string Output only. The unique ID of the assigned targeting option. The ID is only unique within a given resource and targeting type. It may be reused in other contexts.
---@field thirdPartyVerifierDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ThirdPartyVerifierAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Third party verification details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_THIRD_PARTY_VERIFIER`.
---@field categoryDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.CategoryAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Category details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CATEGORY`. Targeting a category will also target its subcategories. If a category is excluded from targeting and a subcategory is included, the exclusion will take precedence.
---@field poiDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.PoiAssignedTargetingOptionDetails POI details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_POI`.
---@field exchangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ExchangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Exchange details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_EXCHANGE`.
---@field viewabilityDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ViewabilityAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Viewability details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_VIEWABILITY`. You can only target one viewability option per resource.
---@field regionalLocationListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.RegionalLocationListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Regional location list details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_REGIONAL_LOCATION_LIST`.
---@field youtubeChannelPackDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.YoutubeChannelPackAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube channel pack details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_PACK`.
---@field audienceGroupDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AudienceGroupAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audience targeting details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIENCE_GROUP`. You can only target one audience group option per resource.
---@field businessChainDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.BusinessChainAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Business chain details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_BUSINESS_CHAIN`.
---@field operatingSystemDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.OperatingSystemAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Operating system details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_OPERATING_SYSTEM`.
---@field nativeContentPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.NativeContentPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Native content position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_NATIVE_CONTENT_POSITION`.
---@field authorizedSellerStatusDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AuthorizedSellerStatusAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Authorized seller status details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUTHORIZED_SELLER_STATUS`. You can only target one authorized seller status option per resource. If a resource doesn't have an authorized seller status option, all authorized sellers indicated as DIRECT or RESELLER in the ads.txt file are targeted by default.
---@field deviceMakeModelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DeviceMakeModelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Device make and model details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DEVICE_MAKE_MODEL`.
---@field userRewardedContentDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.UserRewardedContentAssignedTargetingOptionDetails User rewarded content details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_USER_REWARDED_CONTENT`.
---@field contentDurationDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ContentDurationAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content duration details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_DURATION`.
---@field parentalStatusDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ParentalStatusAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Parental status details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_PARENTAL_STATUS`.
---@field videoPlayerSizeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.VideoPlayerSizeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Video player size details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_VIDEO_PLAYER_SIZE`.
---@field channelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.ChannelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Channel details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CHANNEL`.
---@field browserDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.BrowserAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Browser details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_BROWSER`.
---@field inheritance? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AssignedTargetingOptionInheritanceEnum|string Output only. The inheritance status of the assigned targeting option.
