---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DemandGenBiddingStrategy
---@field type? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.DemandGenBiddingStrategyTypeEnum|string Optional. The type of the bidding strategy. This can only be set when assigned to a line item. Ad groups will inherit this value from their line item.
