---@field effectiveBiddingValue? string Output only. The value effectively used by the bidding strategy. This field will be the same as value if set. If value is not set and the strategy is assigned to an ad group, this field will be inherited from the line item's bidding strategy. If type is not `DEMAND_GEN_BIDDING_STRATEGY_TYPE_TARGET_CPA` or `DEMAND_GEN_BIDDING_STRATEGY_TYPE_TARGET_ROAS`, this field will be 0.
