---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.PatchAdvertisersRequest
---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserEntityStatusEnum|string Required. Controls whether or not insertion orders and line items of the advertiser can spend their budgets and bid on inventory. * Accepted values are `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE`, `ENTITY_STATUS_PAUSED` and `ENTITY_STATUS_SCHEDULED_FOR_DELETION`. * If set to `ENTITY_STATUS_SCHEDULED_FOR_DELETION`, the advertiser will be deleted 30 days from when it was first scheduled for deletion.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the advertiser.
---@field servingConfig? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserTargetingConfig Targeting settings related to ad serving of the advertiser.
---@field partnerId? string Required. Immutable. The unique ID of the partner that the advertiser belongs to.
---@field adServerConfig? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserAdServerConfig Required. Immutable. Ad server related settings of the advertiser.
---@field containsEuPoliticalAds? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserContainsEuPoliticalAdsEnum|string Optional. Whether this advertiser contains line items that serve European Union political ads. If this field is set to `DOES_NOT_CONTAIN_EU_POLITICAL_ADVERTISING`, then the following will happen: * Any new line items created under this advertiser will be assigned `DOES_NOT_CONTAIN_EU_POLITICAL_ADVERTISING` if not otherwise specified. * Any existing line items under this advertiser that do not have a set value be updated to `DOES_NOT_CONTAIN_EU_POLITICAL_ADVERTISING` within a day.
---@field integrationDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.IntegrationDetails Integration details of the advertiser. Only integrationCode is currently applicable to advertiser. Other fields of IntegrationDetails are not supported and will be ignored if provided.
---@field prismaEnabled? boolean Whether integration with Mediaocean (Prisma) is enabled. By enabling this, you agree to the following: On behalf of my company, I authorize Mediaocean (Prisma) to send budget segment plans to Google, and I authorize Google to send corresponding reporting and invoices from DV360 to Mediaocean for the purposes of budget planning, billing, and reconciliation for this advertiser.
---@field creativeConfig? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserCreativeConfig Required. Creative related settings of the advertiser.
---@field defaultLogoAssetId? string Optional. The asset ID of the default logo image for the advertiser. This is the asset ID that will be used by YouTube and Demand ads under this advertiser if a logo asset is not provided. You must use advertisers.adAssets.upload to upload this asset using the API.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the advertiser was last updated. Assigned by the system.
---@field dataAccessConfig? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserDataAccessConfig Settings that control how advertiser data may be accessed.
---@field defaultBusinessName? string Optional. The default business name for the advertiser. This is the value used by YouTube and Demand Gen ads under this advertiser if a business name is not provided.
---@field generalConfig? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v2.AdvertiserGeneralConfig Required. General settings of the advertiser.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the advertiser. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 240 bytes.
---@field advertiserId string Output only. The unique ID of the advertiser. Assigned by the system.
---@field updateMask? string Required. The mask to control which fields to update.

